flowchart TB
    subgraph startup[Implemented startup - explicit native root authority]
        Config[IdeConfig and public register_ide]
        Freeze[Typed bootstrap registration and freeze]
        Factory[InspectFactory creates task and opens root]
        Config --> Freeze --> Factory
    end
    subgraph runtime[Implemented single-shot inspection]
        CLI[Thin CLI - inspect ROOT or help]
        Bridge[Shared bridge - header, admission, variant]
        Provider[Host Singleton acquires task]
        Task[InspectTask - typed traversal policy]
        Files[Injected IoClient - rooted native List and Read]
        Parser[Pure Rust parser - token checks and syn]
        Report[Typed tree and declaration hierarchy]
        YAML[Optional bounded YAML boundary]
        Console[Console IoClient - prepared bytes]
        CLI --> Bridge --> Provider --> Task
        Task --> Files
        Task --> Parser
        Task --> Report --> YAML --> Console
    end
    Factory -. ready task .-> Provider
    Bridge -. help .-> Console
